7. Scene 2: the journey slide (the wave, three beats, scratches)
Transition. When the visitor starts scrolling, the hero background stays fixed in place (position fixed behind everything). The hero text lifts and fades. The top edge of the Journey slide is a hand-drawn wave that rises from the bottom of the screen over the fixed hero, scrubbed by scroll with an airy whoosh at its start. The wave edge keeps undulating gently (about 6 px, 6 s) while visible.
Layout (match ref-journey-scratches). Peach background. A pinned scene of about 4 screens of scroll. On the inline-start: the title and a list of three beats with numbered bubbles. On the inline-end: an image area (a soft arched frame with a paper border) where one image per beat appears (journey-beat-1, journey-beat-2, journey-beat-3).
Copy. Title EN: “I never start with a solution. I start with a question.” (“question” in lavender italic) AR: “أنا مبدأش بحل. أنا ببدأ بسؤال.” Beats: 1) EN “A curious question that won’t let go.” AR “سؤال فضولي مابيسيبنيش.” 2) EN “Real market research, to understand what my clients actually need.” AR “ماركت ريسيرش قوي، أفهم بيه احتياج عميلي الحقيقي.” 3) EN “Critical thinking, to doubt even my own first answer.” AR “تفكير نقدي، يخلّيني أشك حتى في أول إجابة عندي.” In each beat the key phrase (“curious question”, “market research”, “critical thinking”) is in an accent color. Closing line EN “And a few scratches along the way.” AR “وشوية سكراتشات في الطريق.” Button EN “Where it started: FERTICAL” AR “من هنا بدأت: FERTICAL”.
Motion.
• Each beat rises in word by word, its number bubble blooms with a small overshoot, a soft pluck plays, and its image enters on the right with a soft curved clip-path reveal growing from the bubble’s direction, settling with a 1 degree tilt. The previous image recedes behind it, smaller and fainter, and at most two remain faintly stacked.
• The closing line arrives. Then the word “scratches” is scribbled over by hand: three rough rose-colored pen strokes drawn one after another (stroke-dashoffset, uneven width, slight wobble, about 500 ms each), each with a scratch sound burst, while the line shakes about 1 px.
• From the end of the last stroke, a dotted line unspools downward in a long soft curve and keeps travelling off the bottom of the screen. This same line becomes the roadmap in Scene 3 and must continue without restarting. The button appears after the line; clicking it jumps to the first station.
• Mobile: the image area sits above the list.
8. Scene 3: Experiences (the road, the stations, the file popup)
Structure. One pinned stage of 100svh holds a tall hand-drawn world (the road and four stations). A camera follows the drawn tip of the road: the world translates so the tip stays near 45% of the viewport height, so every station is centered when reached and nothing ever sits below the fold. Total scroll length about 160svh per station. Order of stations: FERTICAL, CVeeeZ, X-FUSE, Career CV.
Intro ribbons. Before the first station, a caption EN “Some months, I was doing three roles at once.” AR “في شهور كتير، كنت بشتغل في 3 أدوار في نفس الوقت.” with four translucent, softly curved ribbon bands on a shared calendar overlapping where the roles overlapped: FERTICAL Jan 2023 to May 2025 (lavender), CVeeeZ Sep 2024 to Nov 2025 (coral), X-FUSE Apr 2025 to Dec 2025 (sage), Career CV Nov 2025 to Mar 2026 (amber). Ribbons flow in from the inline-start one after another, sliding along a slight curve and settling with a tiny overshoot; overlaps deepen in tone gently; they fade as the road starts.
The road. The dotted line from Scene 2 continues as one hand-drawn dotted road that sweeps from inline-end to inline-start and back in long wide S-curves built from cubic Bézier segments (never a straight diagonal), threaded between roadmap-foliage-a and -b. It is a faint ghost before it is drawn; scroll draws it with inertia, like ink flowing, and paper-plane rides the tip, turning with the curve tangent. Recompute the geometry on resize. On mobile the road becomes a gently winding vertical path.
Station card (match the current design in the reference screenshots, but keep the card within 24 px of its medallion). A circular medallion holding the company logo (logo-fertical, logo-cveeez, logo-xfuse, logo-careercv) with a lavender ring and soft shadow; a dashed date pill under it (for example “Jan 2023 – May 2025”); above the card a four-dot stepper showing the current station; the role in Playfair Display; the company name in small lavender capitals; a one-line headline; a large stat with a small label (hidden when empty); and a dark pill button “Open the file” / “افتح الملف” that opens the popup. When the drawn tip reaches a station: the medallion blooms (scale 0.85 to 1 with a soft overshoot, a warm halo ring, a few twinkling sparkles), a glass chime plays, the date, role and company rise in one by one (16 px, 100 ms stagger), the headline appears word by word, then the stat counts up and settles.
Bridge lines appear between stations, revealed word by word with scroll while paper-plane glides across on a curved arc. A (before CVeeeZ): EN “In parallel, I took the same question into a company: CVeeeZ.” AR “وبالتوازي، خدت نفس السؤال ودخلت شركة: CVeeeZ.” B (before X-FUSE): EN “It worked. So when the director asked me to help build something new, I knew where to start: a question.” AR “نجح. فلما المدير طلب مني أساعده نبني حاجة جديدة، عرفت أبدأ منين: بسؤال.” C (before Career CV): EN “A tighter role came next: pure sales.” AR “وبعدها دور أكتر تركيزًا: مبيعات بس.”
The file popup (all stations). It opens when the pointer rests on a station (medallion or card) for 250 ms, when the button is clicked or focused with Enter, or on tap. Hover opens it as a light popup; a click pins it open with a close button (so it can be read), and Esc closes it. The page dims with a feathered vignette (about 35%, never a flat overlay) centered on the station. The popup unfolds like a soft paper note (scale 0.96 to 1, fade over 350 ms, tilt about 1 degree, soft shadow, following the pointer with a gentle lag of about 12 px) with a paper rustle. It holds three blocks (Challenge, What I did, Result) in the current language and the station’s images. When the pointer leaves both the station and the popup (and it is not pinned), it fades in 250 ms. On touch it is a bottom sheet with a drag handle; swipe down closes.
